                "content": "You can loop through the array items by using a for loop:\n\nExample\n\n thisarray <- c(1:24)\nmultiarray <- array(thisarray, dim = c(4, 3, 2))\n\nfor(x in multiarray){\n  print(x)\n}\n\nTry it Yourself »\n\n❮ Previous\nNext ❯\n\n ★\n\n +1\n\n Sign in to track progress\n\n REMOVE ADS",
